+
+**Let extension timer calls finish while an owning consumer awaits a pending continuation or provider result…**
+
+- **Source:** PiG's own defect
+- **Symptom:** Let extension timer calls finish while an owning consumer awaits a pending continuation or provider result, while preserving ready-reaction order and native host-call acknowledgement.
+- **Root cause:** Track pending event and result consumers in their shared continuation executor. Open the existing loop wait only after runnable reactions drain, and close it before admitting the next continuation. Keep native host-call connection binding and synchronous acknowledgement unchanged.
